### ===============================================================
### AUTHENTICATION APIS (LOGIN & REGISTER)
### ===============================================================

### 1. Register User 1 (Anurag)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "anurag",
  "email": "anurag@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "fullName": "Anurag Sharma"
}

###

### 2. Register User 2 (Priya)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "priya",
  "email": "priya@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "fullName": "Priya Patel"
}

###

### 3. Login User 1 (with Username)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usernameOrEmail": "anurag",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### 4. Login User 2 (with Email)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usernameOrEmail": "priya@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### 5. Test Invalid Login (Wrong Password -> 401 Unauthorized)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usernameOrEmail": "anurag",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}

###

### ===============================================================
### PER-USER APPLIANCE MANAGEMENT APIS
### ===============================================================

### 6. Add Appliance for User 1 (e.g. userId = 1)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/appliances
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Anurag AC",
  "powerWatts": 1500,
  "hoursPerDay": 8,
  "daysUsed": 30,
  "electricityRate": 8.0,
  "userId": 1
}

###

### 7. Add Appliance for User 2 (e.g. userId = 2)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/appliances
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Priya Refrigerator",
  "powerWatts": 250,
  "hoursPerDay": 24,
  "daysUsed": 30,
  "electricityRate": 8.0,
  "userId": 2
}

###

### 8. Get Appliances for User 1 Only (?userId=1)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/appliances?userId=1
Accept: application/json

###

### 9. Get Appliances for User 2 Only (?userId=2)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/appliances?userId=2
Accept: application/json

###

### 10. Get All Appliances (Admin / Global)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/appliances
Accept: application/json

###

### 11. Update Appliance (change ID as needed)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/appliances/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Anurag Inverter AC",
  "powerWatts": 1200,
  "hoursPerDay": 6,
  "daysUsed": 30,
  "electricityRate": 8.0,
  "userId": 1
}

###

### 12. Delete Appliance (change ID as needed)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/appliances/1
